    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Milestone is a first-person walking simulation game set in a medieval fantasy world where you explore anomalies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can reach the end by carefully observing the changes and finding secrets hidden everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Exploration</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically, you control with WASD and mouse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you find anomaly, go back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything seems normal, keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are occasionally special items you can interact with, so it's recommended to explore thoroughly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk factors</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies can be hostile and dangerous. Be careful not to lose your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to legend, finding the correct path about 15 times may allow you to escape the cursed place. Of course, this may vary depending on the type of curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains visual depictions of severed body parts and human remains, scenes that may trigger photosensitive seizures, depictions of spiders, and sudden horror elements. Viewer discretion is advised.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Milestone is a first-person walking simulation game set in a medieval fantasy world where you explore anomalies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can reach the end by carefully observing the changes and finding secrets hidden everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomaly Exploration</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically, you control with WASD and mouse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you find anomaly, go back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything seems normal, keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are occasionally special items you can interact with, so it's recommended to explore thoroughly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk factors</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some anomalies can be hostile and dangerous. Be careful not to lose your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to legend, finding the correct path about 15 times may allow you to escape the cursed place. Of course, this may vary depending on the type of curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains visual depictions of severed body parts and human remains, scenes that may trigger photosensitive seizures, depictions of spiders, and sudden horror elements. Viewer discretion is advised.</p>",
